que comprei na promoção pois é dinheiro perdido.", "timestamp_created": 1740265112, "timestamp_updated": 1740265112, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.484000027179718018", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188421358", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050308578", "personaname": "A Janta Ta Pronta", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198050308578/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2976, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2896, "last_played": 1761509380, "avatar": "f630ab8da6f8cf07ca6fab6570fd0b7e8df19602"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Você começa o jogo e não entende nada.\r\nUm gigante tenta te matar, se você sobreviver e passar, um gordo de ácido tenta te matar, se passar uma bruxa te caça até te engolir.\r\nOs personagens tem falar esquisitas e engraçadas.\r\nSe você conseguir passar, parabéns, passou a primeira tela.\r\nA segunda tela tem um gigante tão grande que não cabe no seu campo de visão.\r\nBoa sorte.", "timestamp_created": 1740156182, "timestamp_updated": 1740156182, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188298800", "author": {"steamid": "76561198178944693", "personaname": "Lamento da Viúva", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ViniciusBidu/", "num_games_owned": 307, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 624, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 624, "last_played": 1739939637, "avatar": "d3eb39d70f297a4191bea908797cd7972a77ad86"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Achei a campanha meio curta, e pouca gente ainda joga. O ato 5 e 6 não vem incluso no jogo base. A proposta do jogo até que boa, mas ainda compensa mais jogar Left 4 Dead 2. Em uma promoção de 90% até que vale.", "timestamp_created": 1740003402, "timestamp_updated": 1740003402, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.654088079929351807", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188276291", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165375265", "personaname": "LordDark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lordedark/", "num_games_owned": 286, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 189, "last_played": 1740070326, "avatar": "f8e6ef113f6b809aaa862e81c3242f5cc239d9f3"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Excelente game", "timestamp_created": 1739979869, "timestamp_updated": 1739979869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}